{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25098","headline":"北原情三首 二 · 刘言史","name":"北原情三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳城北山，古今葬冥客。\n聚骨朽成泥，此山土多白。\n近来送葬人，亦去闻归声。\n岂能车轮疾，渐是墓侵城。\n城中人不绝，哀挽相次行。\n莫非北邙後，重向洛城生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}